ind":"announcement","title":"Thanks for feedback","summary":"I’ve been reading all of your comments and suggestions, and I’m incredibly grateful for your support! The game is still a bit rough around the edges, but with a community like you, I know we can make it truly amazing. Thank you for helping me shape the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T04:15:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067924930","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4716300-1844751498224860","game_id":"steam-4716300","kind":"update","title":"Demo version update 1.5","summary":"-Improved background music-Eased up fishing mechanic / Simplified fishing-Added warnings when entering dangerous zones-Reworked stamina consumption and recovery system-Tweaked chapter selection menu-Added more hints and tips-Fixed known bugs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T15:01:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224860","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4716300-1844751498217853","game_id":"steam-4716300","kind":"update","title":"Demo version update 1.4","summary":"Demo version update 1.4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T09:19:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217853","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:25Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4716300-1843481262702781","game_id":"steam-4716300","kind":"announcement","title":"demo version bugfix #1","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T19:20:00Z","time_precision":"minute","sou